  "closed_gap": "The load-excluded P7 harness can now select and label the hidden iterator, protocol-sink, canonical-digest, and portable-artifact consumers independently. It records consumer-specific metrics, hashes those metrics and the selected surface into the evidence binding, measures observable iterator/sink time to first output, and explicitly marks aggregate digest/artifact first-edge latency as unobservable.",
