    "This fixture is a correctness smoke, not an NCIT, DOID, GO, million-axiom, licensed-corpus, RSS, or threshold result.",
    "The ordinary public iterator, sink, digest, and artifact methods still cannot select the hidden cursor because the feature remains unadvertised.",
    "Digest and artifact APIs return aggregate results, so their first-edge latency is deliberately recorded as unobservable rather than inferred.",
    "Arbitrary slices, mmap, overlay, composite, and other segmented structural providers remain unsupported by the Rust kernel.",
